    {
      "source": "The default implementation processes locations analogous to\n<a href=\"../support/AbstractContextLoader.html#processLocations(java.lang.Class,java.lang.String...)\"><code>AbstractContextLoader.processLocations(Class, String...)</code></a>, using the\n<a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html#getDeclaringClass()\"><code>declaring class</code></a>\nas the test class and the <a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html#getLocations()\"><code>resource locations</code></a> retrieved from the supplied\n<a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>configuration attributes</code></a> as the\nlocations to process.",
      "translation": "默认实现处理位置的方式类似于 <a href=\"../support/AbstractContextLoader.html#processLocations(java.lang.Class,java.lang.String...)\"><code>AbstractContextLoader.processLocations(Class, String...)</code></a>，使用<a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html#getDeclaringClass()\"><code>声明类</code></a>作为测试类，并使用从提供的<a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>配置属性</code></a>中检索的<a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html#getLocations()\"><code>资源位置</code></a>作为要处理的位置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the <a href=\"../ContextLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>ContextLoader</code></a> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">class</a> to use for the\nsupplied list of <a href=\"../ContextConfigurationAttributes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>ContextConfigurationAttributes</code></a> and then instantiate\nand return that <code>ContextLoader</code>.",
