    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../ContextCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>ContextCustomizer</code></a> that should be used to customize a\n<a href=\"../../../context/ConfigurableApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ConfigurableApplicationContext</code></a>\nbefore it is refreshed.",
